    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Clod &amp; Desire</strong>, you play... absolutely no one. There\u2019s no main character, no plot twist, no enemy to defeat\u2014just you and your power to place benches and hydrangeas wherever your heart desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it as a love letter to ground textures, decorative stones, and the profound existential mystery of where to put a tree.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt terrain like a bored god</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place plants with reckless artistic ambition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the sunset over your perfectly symmetrical hedge maze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No goals. No stress. Just vibes and compost</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of landscape design, without the back pain or HOA complaints.<br><strong>Clod &amp; Desire</strong> is a quiet scream into the loamy abyss.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Clod &amp; Desire</strong>, you play... absolutely no one. There\u2019s no main character, no plot twist, no enemy to defeat\u2014just you and your power to place benches and hydrangeas wherever your heart desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it as a love letter to ground textures, decorative stones, and the profound existential mystery of where to put a tree.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt terrain like a bored god</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place plants with reckless artistic ambition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the sunset over your perfectly symmetrical hedge maze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No goals. No stress. Just vibes and compost</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of landscape design, without the back pain or HOA complaints.<br><strong>Clod &amp; Desire</strong> is a quiet scream into the loamy abyss.</p>",
    "short_description": "A landscape park simulator. Dirt. Plants. And way too much emotion.",
